  << /ActualText (T\055shaped UX\057UI Designer with end\055to\055end experience\054 connecting UX Research\054 information architecture\054 user flows\054 wireframes\054 high\055fidelity prototyping and UI Design with front\055end implementation\056 I focus on turning real user problems into intuitive\054 accessible and consistent digital experiences aligned with product goals\056\n\nI hold a degree in Systems Analysis and Development from UNIP and completed the Google UX Design Professional Certificate\054 strengthening my knowledge of research\054 problem definition\054 ideation\054 prototyping\054 usability testing and iteration\056\n\nMy technical background in React\054 React Native and TypeScript supports close collaboration with developers and reduces friction during design\055to\055development handoff\056\n\nI have experience with Design Systems\054 structuring components\054 visual hierarchy and interface consistency\054 from Figma through implementation\056 I incorporate generative AI into the design process to accelerate research\054 ideation and prototyping while maintaining quality\054 accessibility and real\055user validation standards\056\n\nI work with UX Research\054 Usability Testing\054 Equity\054 Design Systems\054 Figma\054 React\054 React Native and TypeScript\056\n\nI am seeking to contribute to product teams in a strategic and hands\055on capacity\054 helping solve complex problems and continuously improve digital products\056)
