  << /ActualText (Worked as a UX\057UI Designer and Mobile Front\055End Developer in a multidisciplinary team of four\054 leading the end\055to\055end design process \050research\054 user flows and high\055fidelity prototyping\051 for an integrated technical support ticket management system across mobile\054 web and desktop\056\n\nImplemented the mobile application in React Native\054 using generative AI tools to accelerate development\056 The other team members developed the back end\054 API and database\054 with academic guidance from professors specializing in Software Architecture\054 Database Analysis and related fields throughout the project\056\n\nConducted interviews and usability tests with 11 participants \050seven classmates from the Systems Analysis and Development program\054 two students from another class and two Psychology students\051\054 as well as supervising professors\056 Achieved an 85\045 task completion rate without prior guidance\054 validating interface clarity\056 The findings reshaped the product backlog and improved user navigation\056 The capstone project received a score of 8\0565\05710 from the evaluation panel\056)
